{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>深圳前海博物館本月底開館，其中館藏有10件展品，是來自國家博物館的「明星文物」。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.MUSEUM-2000_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026lVhrukuYCw1792412199.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>前海博物館位於前海合作區前灣片區，總面積超過12萬平方米，展廳超過4萬平方米，本月30日下午2時正式開放，屆時會有八個大型展覽，展出至少3,000件文物，包括禮器重鼎、傳世美玉、歷代名瓷等，更有子龍青銅鼎等10件來自國家博物館的知名文物，展出至明年元旦假期結束。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.MUSEUM-2000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026TNlTDFOUNJ1792412187.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>博物館首日開放提供5,000個預約名額，翌日起有8,000個。民眾可透過微信官方小程序提前七日預約，門票介乎48元至128元人民幣，本月23日、25日試運行。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T13:20:02.833501+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":252,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T11:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T19:57:57.691832+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T13:17:41.708426+00:00","content_hash":"14503e899d3e57f7a577ccc0cedaea87230fb62f33987c994025f39fdd158a69","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}